sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent<br/>(Claude Code / Codex)
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS edge
    participant Uvicorn as uvicorn<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant OIDC as OIDCAuthMiddleware<br/>ASGI Middleware
    participant RBAC as RBAC Checker<br/>SubjectAccessReview
    participant MCP as FastMCP Server<br/>Tool Registry
    participant Plugin as Domain Plugin<br/>(e.g. Notebooks)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>8080/8443 TCP

    Note over Agent, MR: Flow 1: AI Agent Tool Invocation (OIDC enabled)

    Agent->>Route: POST /mcp (MCP streamable-http)<br/>Auth: Bearer OCP OAuth token
    Route->>Uvicorn: Forward HTTP/8000<br/>TLS terminated at edge
    Uvicorn->>OIDC: ASGI request dispatch

    OIDC->>K8s: POST /apis/authentication.k8s.io/v1/tokenreviews<br/>Auth: SA token
    K8s-->>OIDC: TokenReview response<br/>(username, groups, uid)

    OIDC->>RBAC: Authenticated user context
    RBAC->>K8s: POST /apis/authorization.k8s.io/v1/subjectaccessreviews<br/>Auth: SA token
    K8s-->>RBAC: Allowed tools list

    RBAC->>MCP: Filtered tool set for user
    MCP->>Plugin: Dispatch tool call<br/>(e.g. create_workbench)
    Plugin->>K8s: CRUD operation<br/>Auth: User's Bearer token
    K8s-->>Plugin: Resource response

    Plugin-->>MCP: Tool result
    MCP-->>Uvicorn: MCP response
    Uvicorn-->>Route: HTTP response
    Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response

    Note over Agent, MR: Flow 2: Model Registry Query

    Agent->>Route: POST /mcp<br/>Tool: list_registered_models
    Route->>Uvicorn: Forward
    Uvicorn->>OIDC: Validate token
    OIDC->>MCP: Authenticated
    MCP->>Plugin: Dispatch to Model Registry domain
    Plugin->>MR: GET /api/model_registry/v1alpha3/registered_models<br/>Auth: None or OAuth/Bearer
    MR-->>Plugin: Model list response
    Plugin-->>MCP: Tool result
    MCP-->>Route: MCP response
    Route-->>Agent: HTTPS response

    Note over Agent, MR: Flow 3: Workflow Token Chain (multi-step)

    Agent->>Route: POST /mcp<br/>Tool: prepare_training
    Route->>MCP: (auth validated)
    MCP->>Plugin: Composite: validate storage, credentials, runtimes
    Plugin->>K8s: Multiple SubjectAccessReview + resource reads
    K8s-->>Plugin: Validation results
    Plugin-->>MCP: Result + HMAC-signed workflow token
    MCP-->>Agent: {result, workflow_token}

    Agent->>Route: POST /mcp<br/>Tool: train (with workflow_token)
    Route->>MCP: (auth validated)
    MCP->>Plugin: Verify HMAC token, check TTL
    Plugin->>K8s: Create TrainJob CR
    K8s-->>Plugin: TrainJob created
    Plugin-->>Agent: Training job status
